    "name": "Mirages of Winter",
    "steam_appid": 1937510,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937510/extras/8bac53375c283e1d605397f185180cfd.poster.avif?t=1752447398\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937510/extras/8bac53375c283e1d605397f185180cfd.webm?t=1752447398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937510/extras/8bac53375c283e1d605397f185180cfd.mp4?t=1752447398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Poetic Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an island during winter; living a simple life together with nature. By following the footsteps of the fisherman, you will uncover the hidden beauty of winter and witness the coming of spring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An immersive first-person adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve nature-inspired puzzles to uncover the secrets of the Winter Island. Explore hand-painted scenery, find the five elements and combine them with objects, plants and cute animals to open new paths towards spring. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937510/extras/0b7ad47a09dd081cbd745e68ff483f6f.poster.avif?t=1752447398\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937510/extras/0b7ad47a09dd081cbd745e68ff483f6f.webm?t=1752447398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937510/extras/0b7ad47a09dd081cbd745e68ff483f6f.mp4?t=1752447398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Sumi-e world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a fully hand-drawn, interactive landscape filled with curious creatures and hidden details \u2014 all inspired by Taoist and Zen philosophy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">with poems</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover inspiring, enchanting verses that celebrate the arrival of spring and quiet moments of harmony with nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">with puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy gentle, nature-inspired puzzles and search for 28 unique animal paintings hidden throughout the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">with a mesmerizing Music</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in an original, uplifting soundtrack composed and performed with traditional bamboo flutes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937510/extras/dc75d52a3c6355dadeed1be1528ffa7a.poster.avif?t=1752447398\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937510/extras/dc75d52a3c6355dadeed1be1528ffa7a.webm?t=1752447398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937510/extras/dc75d52a3c6355dadeed1be1528ffa7a.mp4?t=1752447398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937510/extras/8bac53375c283e1d605397f185180cfd.poster.avif?t=1752447398\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937510/extras/8bac53375c283e1d605397f185180cfd.webm?t=1752447398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937510/extras/8bac53375c283e1d605397f185180cfd.mp4?t=1752447398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Poetic Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an island during winter; living a simple life together with nature. By following the footsteps of the fisherman, you will uncover the hidden beauty of winter and witness the coming of spring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An immersive first-person adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve nature-inspired puzzles to uncover the secrets of the Winter Island. Explore hand-painted scenery, find the five elements and combine them with objects, plants and cute animals to open new paths towards spring. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937510/extras/0b7ad47a09dd081cbd745e68ff483f6f.poster.avif?t=1752447398\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937510/extras/0b7ad47a09dd081cbd745e68ff483f6f.webm?t=1752447398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937510/extras/0b7ad47a09dd081cbd745e68ff483f6f.mp4?t=1752447398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Sumi-e world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a fully hand-drawn, interactive landscape filled with curious creatures and hidden details \u2014 all inspired by Taoist and Zen philosophy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">with poems</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover inspiring, enchanting verses that celebrate the arrival of spring and quiet moments of harmony with nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">with puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy gentle, nature-inspired puzzles and search for 28 unique animal paintings hidden throughout the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">with a mesmerizing Music</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in an original, uplifting soundtrack composed and performed with traditional bamboo flutes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937510/extras/dc75d52a3c6355dadeed1be1528ffa7a.poster.avif?t=1752447398\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937510/extras/dc75d52a3c6355dadeed1be1528ffa7a.webm?t=1752447398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937510/extras/dc75d52a3c6355dadeed1be1528ffa7a.mp4?t=1752447398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
